{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cIt's a roguelike autobattler, Jim, but not as we know it.\u201d</i><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/115712e5a81091e621518b16ea5072d8.poster.avif?t=1772099512\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/115712e5a81091e621518b16ea5072d8.webm?t=1772099512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/115712e5a81091e621518b16ea5072d8.mp4?t=1772099512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a powerful intergalactic starship by interlocking different technologies, then battle through a galaxy populated with other players' creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/c9663b9bb026c1c84856c7ee5db3d12a.avif?t=1772099512\" width=1170 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Konfronto you build your starship by purchasing cargo from the intergalactic trader, and then arranging them in your ship\u2019s hold. Where you place them matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/12b7b435995095ff1df0f691024c9939.avif?t=1772099512\" width=1170 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your playing area by sending Pilots out to clear space in the cargo hold. Or put your Pilots in command of spaceships to increase your power, but they can\u2019t do both at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/fd0cc3921eac09d98ec8fca1e26740b5.avif?t=1772099512\" width=1170 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other players\u2019 creations in head to head battles! Don\u2019t worry, the game is asynchronous. They don't even have to be online when you inevitably crush them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: we have included additional translation above for anyone that hasn't passed their mandatory Space Corps Esperanto qualification.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ripley believe it or not!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994150/764cd3f87ad9ed948aa418531039c8d6fe1612e6.jpg"},{"name":"Tuvok and Roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994150/b724713c3ea362aa737cc70fb3d497b24b546b92.jpg"},{"name":"Shepard's Pie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994150/e757154ae2256b8bde5eb2880b481d453eb0dd52.jpg"},{"name":"Captain Mal-content","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994150/c3f419df0951ded27ce67f24ec1c87669a01d4c2.jpg"},{"name":"Commodore 64","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994150/8ffe0fe3c141e0ac21e26b5776828d6b5f07b630.jpg"},{"name":"Holdo my Beer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994150/622cdc3d0c8e64ea59a3a2f6d5b7613afbde480a.jpg"},{"name":"Adama-geddon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994150/468b9c3eb6c6cb0004d10abc92345b9e45967d01.jpg"},{"name":"Tarkin care of business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea